<title>USA: FSA qualifies South Carolina deal for insurance.</title>
<headline>FSA qualifies South Carolina deal for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Financial Security Assurance said Wednesday it qualified for bond insurance South Carolina's $30.7 million state institution bond deal, set for sale at 1400 EDT.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
